    "hypotheses": [
      "Command-owned order copies and native fill result slots allocate approximately zero bytes after their high-water capacities warm up",
      "Lane may recycle detached authoritative orders only after Owner retires the owning sequence",
      "A completed money prefix can enter Ledger without response retirement, preserving control and sequential-batch fences",
      "Decoder frame/payload reuse cannot overwrite in-flight input or retained egress headers",
      "Borrowed Header lives in the frame slot; egress retains that lease through encoding, leaving only an immutable UUID allocation per frame."
